    "chapter": "Grade 9 - Chapter 3: Cells",
    "yearEC": "2024 E.C.",
    "questionText": "A researcher is investigating a new type of cell. They observe that it has a nucleus, mitochondria, a cell wall, and chloroplasts. However, further analysis reveals the presence of flagella used for movement. This cell is most likely from a:",
    "hasImage": false,
