    "questionText": "A student adds 25.0 mL of water and 10.0 mL of an unknown liquid. The combined mass is 33.55 g. If the mass of the graduated cylinder is 8.77 g, what is the density of the unknown liquid, assuming the density of water is 1.00 g/mL?",
